[{:db/id "q-74716/selection/56bdec9fad73bdb83747ca2507495269b5764b50c7bb11dd36cd46d4688ac2a3" :answer/id #uuid "236a0a53-3192-535d-9fd3-3290d33c57e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4.07" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74716/selection/840c2fe0abbeb5eca740071bd691cb07d27fb10490d6a91d648f068b0e4b435c" :answer/id #uuid "9a94018f-de9e-5a63-a25b-86b1cfa37581" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4.37" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74716/selection/47fcef24068e217f81788cf28dee5f7c8fee720b01ac30dbdfbb7232c0023123" :answer/id #uuid "456b0aae-db26-58b3-8856-bdfa86bf36b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4.40" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74716/selection/0953ed671fafedfda29757c856eb2fff4e236de7f326dfdaa16695e698f6b8f3" :answer/id #uuid "18bc63a2-6f6e-5b02-b4a6-f42c78450921" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4.21" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74716/selection/bb39bc03441051bb52e01b1f65a69a476f4b9fea943b95a1a2d24f356c2b79dc" :answer/id #uuid "a09f194f-6555-5d25-a6ae-f275a2f228b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4.73" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74716/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d20c0c58-a337-5759-8c30-d318f715c97d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-74716/selection/56bdec9fad73bdb83747ca2507495269b5764b50c7bb11dd36cd46d4688ac2a3" :answer-field/choices ["q-74716/selection/56bdec9fad73bdb83747ca2507495269b5764b50c7bb11dd36cd46d4688ac2a3" "q-74716/selection/840c2fe0abbeb5eca740071bd691cb07d27fb10490d6a91d648f068b0e4b435c" "q-74716/selection/47fcef24068e217f81788cf28dee5f7c8fee720b01ac30dbdfbb7232c0023123" "q-74716/selection/0953ed671fafedfda29757c856eb2fff4e236de7f326dfdaa16695e698f6b8f3" "q-74716/selection/bb39bc03441051bb52e01b1f65a69a476f4b9fea943b95a1a2d24f356c2b79dc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-74716" :question/id #uuid "d7a59ae6-0f77-5eca-9ada-6bc7a3f7a2c6" :question/math-academy-id "q-74716" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find, in radians to two decimal places, the argument of $z=-3-4\\text{i}.$ \n\n**Hint**: The argument of a complex number is in the range $[0,2\\pi ).$" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot $z$ in the complex plane.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/assets/7eff12ed4bca73dc27f834b0740b5b2235440250e11427f911c8fc29c99fa1d7.png)\n\nThe complex number $z$ lies in the third quadrant of the complex plane. Therefore $\\pi <arg⁡(z)<\\frac{3\\pi }{2}.$ If $\\alpha $ is the angle that $z$ makes with the negative real axis, then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\alpha  & =arctan⁡(\\frac{4}{3})≈0.927\\,30.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =arg⁡(z)≈\\pi +0.927\\,30≈4.07\n$$\n\nto two decimal places." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-74716/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a560db4d-e9d3-5d89-b2cd-c886f32db9df"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74716"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-170494/selection/acb0aa73e1c86700f6a11f391bfc0b21574b33072b8bce3400c7f30f205864ea" :answer/id #uuid "865ff208-9bda-5e6f-9df1-d71ab2eeddcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4.99" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170494/selection/da890ea2b38895c1306866ca8b0c184d16620825880f14caf74ccf8779f54f7b" :answer/id #uuid "10a8e9ec-047e-5ba2-957a-708df09f56e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5.70" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170494/selection/af9aced3776bacbe55448cafafb84d89a58960cd9f2f1d91b3038c4b41a1c75f" :answer/id #uuid "4739b028-a4ff-57bf-a42b-cc2a72cf51d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5.35" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170494/selection/0049e0117586ca74c3b54d53cfd3ecd202a8098841c366f68b3049b496368365" :answer/id #uuid "dc03f48c-7f95-546a-9aa9-93b29e839962" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4.84" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170494/selection/0b889605733bed6228c980f9097ab8fb0fc569c3969158c2e23a7c5d7760f557" :answer/id #uuid "aadd22e3-4946-555f-a5ef-8ad4b06bbe1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5.97" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170494/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4b814a03-5aab-561f-ae2e-5dcc1016564f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-170494/selection/da890ea2b38895c1306866ca8b0c184d16620825880f14caf74ccf8779f54f7b" :answer-field/choices ["q-170494/selection/acb0aa73e1c86700f6a11f391bfc0b21574b33072b8bce3400c7f30f205864ea" "q-170494/selection/da890ea2b38895c1306866ca8b0c184d16620825880f14caf74ccf8779f54f7b" "q-170494/selection/af9aced3776bacbe55448cafafb84d89a58960cd9f2f1d91b3038c4b41a1c75f" "q-170494/selection/0049e0117586ca74c3b54d53cfd3ecd202a8098841c366f68b3049b496368365" "q-170494/selection/0b889605733bed6228c980f9097ab8fb0fc569c3969158c2e23a7c5d7760f557"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-170494" :question/id #uuid "443ea97b-0750-5e83-b945-577ff014453b" :question/math-academy-id "q-170494" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find, in radians to two decimal places, the argument of $z=9-6\\text{i}.$ \n\n**Hint**: The argument of a complex number is in the range $[0,2\\pi ).$" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot $z$ in the complex plane.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/assets/1bc5f38d44d9df32a7493f8d210bbc17d716d8a63316e3d730a1c4258d56fe46.png)\n\nThe complex number $z$ lies in the fourth quadrant of the complex plane. Therefore $\\frac{3\\pi }{2}<arg⁡(z)<2\\pi .$ \n\nIf $\\alpha $ is the angle that $z$ makes with the positive real axis, then\n\n$$\n\\alpha =arctan⁡(\\frac{6}{9})=arctan⁡(\\frac{2}{3})≈0.588\\,00.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =arg⁡(z)=2\\pi -0.588\\,00≈5.70\n$$\n\nto two decimal places." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-170494/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "54588722-bb80-54ca-b100-03aca39e0c17"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-170494"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-319499/field-1/bba3868abfbca2614b92d49ab7301c71c3eb3f7d7af71e82858ec477821614f9" :answer/id #uuid "700aa052-5bda-5318-a176-5ea7dfe6f9b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2.51" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-319499/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "7d1fca77-3e7f-53e3-960f-0060bd3b8855" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-319499/field-1/bba3868abfbca2614b92d49ab7301c71c3eb3f7d7af71e82858ec477821614f9" :answer-field/choices ["q-319499/field-1/bba3868abfbca2614b92d49ab7301c71c3eb3f7d7af71e82858ec477821614f9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-319499" :question/id #uuid "3a50732f-9ccb-5a9f-8b9e-e2e1266f6493" :question/math-academy-id "q-319499" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find, **in radians**, the argument of $z=-11+8\\text{i}.$ Round your final answer to **two decimal places**.\n\n**Hint**: The argument of a complex number is in the range $[0,2\\pi ).$ \n\n$arg⁡(z)≈$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot $z$ in the complex plane.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/assets/d3b5558c0268843618c52c588ffcf1c8012189041b17d52fadd6fe74c3526700.png)\n\nThe complex number $z$ lies in the second quadrant of the complex plane. Hence $\\frac{\\pi }{2}<arg⁡(z)<\\pi .$ \n\nIf $\\alpha $ is the angle that $z$ makes with the negative real axis, then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}tan⁡\\alpha  & =\\frac{8}{11} \\\\ \\alpha  & =arctan⁡(\\frac{8}{11}) \\\\  & =0.628\\text{ }796\\text{ }…\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =arg⁡(z)=\\pi -0.628\\text{ }796\\text{ }…≈2.51,\n$$\n\nrounded to $2$ decimal places." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-319499/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "833ac63c-235b-5059-ab7c-56eb1e44d79e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-319499"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-319507/field-1/d569d64e1b94dabdc9f89c1070c848c6c96526a20f320d6b4971ae3a32604bcf" :answer/id #uuid "c2002a52-1e83-5344-b1bc-0baa7e781dbb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\pi}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-319507/field-1/ccc5b7f3cfdb4c2dfc0e1f31be54559a1ab3adaf142e500fc1f1b7bc87e93b08" :answer/id #uuid "dd881fba-5af0-5c8a-8787-c82bfdcf5fc9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-319507/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "05787393-74e8-587e-8a1e-ad23ec25a881" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-319507/field-1/d569d64e1b94dabdc9f89c1070c848c6c96526a20f320d6b4971ae3a32604bcf" :answer-field/choices ["q-319507/field-1/d569d64e1b94dabdc9f89c1070c848c6c96526a20f320d6b4971ae3a32604bcf" "q-319507/field-1/ccc5b7f3cfdb4c2dfc0e1f31be54559a1ab3adaf142e500fc1f1b7bc87e93b08"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-319507" :question/id #uuid "5d6c23e8-dfa9-5cf0-bb09-7d2dc3e11620" :question/math-academy-id "q-319507" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find, **in radians**, the **exact value** of the argument of $z=-5+5\\sqrt{3}\\text{i}.$\n\n**Hint**: The argument of a complex number is in the range $[0,2\\pi ).$ \n\n$arg⁡(z)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot $z$ in the complex plane.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/assets/f466a110eda3b07b50d988de6e46a541ad85d7ff64f43a6f056ea216752fa2d9.png)\n\nThe complex number $z$ lies in the second quadrant of the complex plane. Hence $\\frac{\\pi }{2}<arg⁡(z)<\\pi .$ \n\nIf $\\alpha $ is the angle that $z$ makes with the negative real axis, then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}tan⁡\\alpha  & =\\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{5} \\\\ \\alpha  & =arctan⁡(\\sqrt{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =arg⁡(z)=\\pi -\\frac{\\pi }{3}=\\frac{2\\pi }{3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-319507/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "833ac63c-235b-5059-ab7c-56eb1e44d79e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-319507"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-319562/field-1/b8fa621bd31262b9c71e52f4a4687fbda3f213431a09e096356fd500257c4370" :answer/id #uuid "a9f0d7a6-d8c3-5bf9-b154-1f1964a2d46a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5.34" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-319562/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "edf05e22-5e7d-56a1-a953-158c90e18a53" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-319562/field-1/b8fa621bd31262b9c71e52f4a4687fbda3f213431a09e096356fd500257c4370" :answer-field/choices ["q-319562/field-1/b8fa621bd31262b9c71e52f4a4687fbda3f213431a09e096356fd500257c4370"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-319562" :question/id #uuid "019c203e-8df8-505f-8a2f-32d848d7aea4" :question/math-academy-id "q-319562" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find, **in radians**, the argument of $z=8-11\\text{i}.$ Round your final answer to **two decimal places**.\n\n**Hint**: The argument of a complex number is in the range $[0,2\\pi ).$ \n\n$arg⁡(z)≈$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot $z$ in the complex plane.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/assets/16408e6add22c687e3d2cf865908011602bfa87878fcbc3387c4ad3d22180e47.png)\n\nThe complex number $z$ lies in the fourth quadrant of the complex plane. Hence $\\frac{3\\pi }{2}<arg⁡(z)<2\\pi .$ \n\nIf $\\alpha $ is the angle that $z$ makes with the positive real axis, then\n\n$$\n\\alpha =arctan⁡(\\frac{11}{8})=0.942\\,000…\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =arg⁡(z)=2\\pi -0.942\\,000≈5.34,\n$$\n\nrounded to $2$ decimal places." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-319562/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "54588722-bb80-54ca-b100-03aca39e0c17"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-319562"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
